WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.400 --> 00:00:02.570
- My worst gift ever was one year,

00:00:02.570 --> 00:00:06.850
I don't know why, Santa Claus got me a DVD

00:00:06.850 --> 00:00:08.937
of the movie, "Big Chill."

00:00:09.837 --> 00:00:10.800
- "Big Chill"?

00:00:10.800 --> 00:00:12.390
- Again, I'm, like, 13 years old.

00:00:12.390 --> 00:00:16.290
So this is a movie about,
you know, midlife crisis.

00:00:16.290 --> 00:00:18.550
I don't know why I'm on the list

00:00:18.550 --> 00:00:19.655
but I remember going like, "Okay."

00:00:19.655 --> 00:00:21.960
(Kelly laughing)
"Big Chill,"

00:00:21.960 --> 00:00:24.150
about people are trying
to have a baby and stuff.

00:00:24.150 --> 00:00:26.207
Like I, yeah, okay.

00:00:26.207 --> 00:00:28.790
I guess Santa thought
the soundtrack was good,

00:00:28.790 --> 00:00:29.623
that I would like it.

00:00:29.623 --> 00:00:32.850
I love it now that I'm in my 40s,

00:00:32.850 --> 00:00:34.320
but, no, when you're a kid...

00:00:34.320 --> 00:00:36.550
- That's amazing!
No, that was not

00:00:36.550 --> 00:00:37.650
one of my best gifts.

00:00:37.650 --> 00:00:39.750
- That's a weird gift that they
definitely weren't thinking

00:00:39.750 --> 00:00:40.583
of you when they got it.

00:00:40.583 --> 00:00:41.690
Like, that's a weird... (chuckling)

00:00:41.690 --> 00:00:44.000
- I think Santa was thinking of Santa.

00:00:44.000 --> 00:00:46.800
- [Kelly] We forgot to get,
so we just pulled something.

